window.products.push({"id":820056,"name":"Pants Hangers Space Saving Velvet Pants Hangers Non Slip Jeans Hangers Multi Layer Closet Pants Organizer for Trousers Scarf Tie Pack of 4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Sr3o823XL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Material】Trousers Hangers are made of sturdy ABS material with velve,Width 12.59 in,Height 16.14 in, 0.19 inch thick fits for any size closet. Will steadily hold even Jeans Trousers in your closet. 【Space-saving Hanger】Designed with 4 layer, velvet pants hangers keeping your closet much neater,each hanger can hold 5 pants,jeans,slacks, great for freeing closet space. 【Multi Purpose】Our multipurpose jeans hangers not only for organizing your pants, but also a great way to store your ties,scarfs, belt, towels, or even accessories, save the space of your closet while keep it neat and well organized. 【Velvet Pants Hangers】Black Pants hangers with soft velvet that both grips and prevents creases, without leaving any marks after hanging, keeping clothes from wrinkling and creasing. 【Package Included】Packaged included 4 pants hangers, It's normal that There will be a little velet on the trousers hangers. Wash it with water and then dry it to avoid the velvet fall.If you have any questions before or after purchase, please feel free to contact us, we will answer you within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Sr3o823XL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Loucarn","source_asin":"B0BK97TGSM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-820056","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BK97TGSM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BK97TGSM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":820057,"name":"SKG Slow Masticating Juicer Cold Press 36 RPM Big Mouth Juice Extractor,Sliver","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41pEkRYBSiL._AC_.jpg","description":"WIDE 3.15” TURN OVER CHUTE –The A10’s flip over 3.15” (80mm) opening allows for large fruits and vegetables to enter the appliance easily. The A10 also has a 1.75” (45mm) opening which is meant for longer produce. The two openings are designed so produce can easily enter the juicer. BETTER TASTING AND MORE NUTRITIOUS JUICE – Using a slow masticating juicer like the SKG Large Caliber Juicer rather than a centrifugal juicer prevents the rapid oxidation which can be caused by the high-speed spinning of a centrifugal juicer. The powerful 250W AC motor’s slow speed allows each and every piece of produce enough time to have its juice fully extracted, leaving behind only dry pulp and delicious and nutritious juice. MORE JUICE FOR PULP LOVERS AND HATERS ALIKE - The SKG Large Caliber Juicer produces more juice than its competitors (Orange 70%, Pear 81.3%, Apple 78%, Celery 80.5%, Carrot 55%). Both a fine strainer (for purer juice) and a rough strainer (for juice with more pulp) are included for your juicing needs. An innovative second filter further strains out foam and pulp. EASY ASSEMBLY AND DISASSEMBLY, CONVENIENT CLEAN UP – Setting up this juicer takes only a few simple steps unlike many of its competitors. Taking it apart takes even less time and each piece is designed to provide a fast and efficient cleaning process. This juicer have two directions switch: \"Forward\" is used to turn on the machine and start juicing, while \"Reverse\" switch make the motor spin on opposite direction to release the material after juicing, which help to clean the machine easily.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41pEkRYBSiL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SKG","source_asin":"B07PF8LM9H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-820057","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07PF8LM9H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07PF8LM9H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
