window.products.push({"id":820235,"name":"HOTTHING Milk Frother for Coffee, Hand Mixer, Handheld Electric Whisk, Protein Powder Mixer, Battery Operated Drink Mixer for Latte, Cappuccino, Hot C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YlaxFFNhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Milk Frother】: Allows the ability to create foamy cream with milk or cream with the touch of a button. Frothy milk for your coffee, lattes, hot chocolate or cappuccino, it also works great with any type of milk, nut milk, or other dairy products, such as cream and butter. 【3 Levels of Adjustable Speeds】: This allows you to choose between different speeds to achieve ideal frother effect.Low speed for mixing protein powder drinks. Middle speed for making matcha tea. High speed for creating creamy milk foam which can be used for your coffee, latte, cappuccino or desired beverage. 【Durable Materials】: The bubbler is made of 304 stainless steel + ABS plastic, which is sturdy and durable, not easy to rust, even with daily use it will not break or bend. Designed with a reasonable size cylindrical handle and easy to grip ergonomics. Its metal body and components ensure a longer service life and a more aesthetic effects. 【Easy to Clean and Store】: Cleaning up the whisk & frother is even faster. To clean just put the whisk in hot running water and briefly turn it on – instantly clean! When stored on the counter or table it sits nicely next to other complimentary coffee accessories. Our powerful and durable hand-held milk frother is powered by two AA batteries (not included) with a compact electric design that easily fits in the drawer. 【1 Year Worry-free Warranty】: We offer 1 year warranty and 24h friendly customer service. If there are any issues about the product, please feel free to contact us and we will give you a free replacement or full refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YlaxFFNhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOTTHING","source_asin":"B09ZV3NCMR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-820235","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09ZV3NCMR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09ZV3NCMR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
