window.products.push({"id":820249,"name":"Jolitac Bamboo Laundry Hamper and Shelf, Dual Compartments Laundry Basket with Removable Sliding Bags, Large Capacity Laundry Sorter Organizer, Bathro","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ZIdP5wncL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Jolitac Laundry Hamper - - Do you have dirt clothes storage troubles? We designed this laundry basket specially to store your dirty clothes, jackets, and jeans, rather than pile them on the sofa, on the floor messily. You will find a good transfer station for the clothes waiting to be washed. ECO-friendly Natural bamboo - - The natural bamboo frame with bright colors, stable structure, which is more superior than plastic items in terms of home aesthetics. The spacious top panel is suitable for storing sundries. You can place your laundry detergent, shoes, basin or potted plants, etc. Locate it in laundry room, balcony, living room and other places. Large Double Basket - - This laundry storage hamper basket has a large capacity, and the double basket design allows you to sort and storage effectively. According to tops or bottoms, adults or children, light or dark colors. Meet your classification needs. Overall shelf size: 27.6\"x14.2\"x26.4. Single basket bag size: 13.4\"x11.8\"18.9\". Smooth Sliding Rails - - Our sliding rail has been specially polished and lubricated. You can easily pull it out and push it back, which is convenient for you to store, take out your clothes, or take it down and clean it. The cloth basket is made of waterproof fabric. The dark gray color and cotton linen material make it wear resistance and dirt resistance, ensuring a long service life. After-Sales Service - - The package comes with all the installation accessories, just follow the instructions, step by step, and you will find a shelf with a good value for money. If there is any problem with the product and installation, just message us online and we will reply with 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ZIdP5wncL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jolitac","source_asin":"B095714NRP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-820249","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B095714NRP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B095714NRP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":820250,"name":"Amazon Brand – Pinzon Lightweight Cotton Flannel Sheet Set - King, Lavender Plaid","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Fnjc9aYLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Luxurious yarn dyed and available in an assortment of designs, these sheets will add to the comfort of your bedroom. Yarn-dyed fabric for superior quality and plaid patterning on both sides. An Amazon Brand. Amazon.com Pinzon’s cozy flannel sheets are a treat to sleep in. Made in Portugal from 100 percent cotton, with a flannel weight of 160 grams per square meter, the fabric is lightly brushed for a soft, supple feel and is pre-washed for durability. Offered in an array of colors, the set coordinates with Pinzon 160-Gram Solid Flannel duvets and shams, or it mixes and matches with Pinzon patterned flannels. Peruse the wide variety of Pinzon solid, printed, and yard-dyed flannel bedding to create a layered look with an ultra-soft feel. Available in several sizes, the King set offered here includes a 105-by-105-inch flat sheet, a 76-by-80-inch fitted sheet, and two 20-by-41-inch pillowcases. The fitted sheet is designed to fit mattresses up to 18 inches thick. Easy to care for, the set is machine washable and dryable. Fabric Definition Flannel: Flannel fabrics are noted for their fuzzy softness, warmth, and durability, and they can be dyed or printed. Thought to have been popularized in Wales in the 17th century, flannel was an all-wool fabric made of woolen or worsted yarns, with a brushed surface and a soft napped finish obscuring its weave. Flannel may be plain woven or twill woven and, today, most flannel fabrics are made of cotton fibers or synthetic rayon fibers that are slightly napped on both sides to resemble the old woolen or worsted yarn weaves. A wide range of flannel weights and textures is available. The fabric weight and quality of the napping affect the warmth and softness of the fabric. Many people prefer flannel bedding during the cold, winter months, but some flannel weights are appropriate in breathability and comfort all year long.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Fnjc9aYLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pinzon","source_asin":"B00BED4K8A","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-820250","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BED4K8A","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BED4K8A","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
