window.products.push({"id":820277,"name":"Large Cotton Rope Laundry Basket - Baby Laundry, Woven Laundry Basket, Dog Toy Basket, XXL Blanket Basket, Long Handles, Decorative Nursery Hamper | G","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91jFdgN3LfL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Additional Uses: This cotton rope storage jute basket can also fit under the kitchen table, in a pantry or closet, or in the corner of a bedroom. It can be used as a basket for towels in a bathroom. The neutral color combination will match every room in your house! Size and Portability: This laundry basket can be filled with two full loads of laundry! Large handles make it easy to move clothes hamper from dorm room or apartment building to a Laundromat! Because this laundry basket is extra extra large it makes a great blanket basket. This decorative woven rope basket can help declutter your space by storing several blankets and throw pillows at one time. Designed with USE in mind: This neutral color combination not only matches every room in your house but also helps prevent the appearance of stains over time. We know you could be using this for dirty laundry and we designed this to be user friendly. That is why we used a darker neutral color for the bottom half of the basket and an off-white color for the top of the basket. Stains will be less visible on this darker tone grey and cream than on a bright white. So, you can fill your basket with dirty clothes and drag it across the floor without having to worry about staining an all-white woven laundry basket. Care and Cleaning: Please hand wash with warm water using a soap without any bleaches. Rinse and air dry naturally (not in direct sunlight) to avoid any dehydration of the fabric. Creases from folding usually fall out naturally due to the quality of the fabric, but basket can be ironed (see instructions with purchase). LONGEVITY: Our baskets are made with quality materials and handwoven with care! But if you aren’t satisfied, we will replace your basket at no cost to you or issue you a full refund!You’re covered by our 100% Money Guarantee. Click Add to Cart now to own the only Cotton Woven Rope Basket you will need.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91jFdgN3LfL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Know How Organizers","source_asin":"B07WS27WRD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-820277","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WS27WRD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WS27WRD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
