window.products.push({"id":820325,"name":"SKYICE Evaporative Air Cooler, 3-IN-1 Air Conditioner Portable for Room w/ 4 Modes & 3 Speed, 12H Timer, 1 Gal Detachable Water Tank, 4 Ice Packs, Rem","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":99.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kpuauxqpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❄️【3-IN-1 Versatile Portable Air Solution】SKYICE multifunctional air cooler combines an air cooler, humidifier, and floor fan in one. Enjoy air conditioning in summer, humidification in winter, and use it as a tower fan without water. Includes 4 ice packs for added cooling. Just add ice water and ice packs to the tank for enhanced cooling. Year-round comfort is made easy. ❄️【3-Speed & 4-Mode Options DIY Your Climate】Select from 4 modes (Normal/Natural/Sleep/Cooling) and 3 speeds (Low/Medium/High) for 12 unique cooling effects. With an upgraded impeller wheel and cooling pad, this evaporative cooler delivers large cool, moist air at up to 20ft/s. It effectively cools rooms with a high air volume of 10,594 cubic feet per hour. ❄️【Easy Control with Touch & Remote】Top touch panel and remote control for effortless settings. Use the infrared remote to power on/off, adjust speeds, modes, swing, and set timer. Control from up to 20ft away, even from a sofa or bed. No more complex buttons. Choose SKYICE portable air conditioners with remote for convenient cooling control. ❄️【Top Refilling & Large Water Tank for 7 Hours Cooling】No more bending to refill water! Our air cooler for room has a top-fill design, ideal for seniors and pregnant women. The 1-gallon bottom tank lasts up to 7 hours, so you can enjoy uninterrupted cooling throughout the night. It automatically stops the pump when water is low, ensuring safety. Monitor the water level with the window. Easy cleaning and refilling with detachable tanks. ❄️【12-Hour Timer & Ultra-Quiet at 60dB】Set it and forget it with the convenient 12-hour timer function of this windowless air conditioner. Enjoy a gentle breeze while you sleep or cool your room before you arrive, all while ensuring energy efficiency. What truly stands out is its whisper-quiet operation at only 60 dB. Experience uninterrupted relaxation, work, or sleep without any disturbing noise. ❄️【Powerful and Widespread Wind】This portable air cooler fan with robust 429 CFM air flow, covering 300 sq. ft, surpasses regular fans in reach and strength. Enjoy a broader circulation of cool air with its wider outlet and 90-degree automatic oscillation, revitalizing your entire family. Rest easy with ETL certification and a narrow safety grille, protecting your loved ones. Plus, the safety fuse plug guards against overvoltage and power surges. ❄️【Easy to Use & Energy Cost Saving】SKYICE small air conditioner no hose installation, no window needed, just plug and play and then enjoy cool airflow. The indoor swamp cooler's working power is only 60W, compared to traditional wall-mounted air conditioners: with lower installation and maintenance costs, and up to 75% less electricity usage to reduce the bills. ❄️【Lightweight & Easy to Move】Enjoy the ease of our space-saving, compact, and portable AC. Weighing just 8.37 lbs, it's easily movable with 4 wheels and a built-in handle making it easier to move from one place to another. No matter where you need cool air, from outdoors to indoors, such as patios, garages, offices, living rooms, camping, and more. The best choice for hot and dry weather. ❄️【Easy Maintenance Ensures Safety Use】Detachable water tank, cooling pad, and rear grille make regular cleaning and maintenance a breeze. Enjoy cleaning and cool air at all times only from this room air conditioner. ❄️ 【What Can You Get】Package List: 1 x Air Cooler; 4 x Ice Packs(Contains powdered gel inside. To transform it into a gel-like substance, simply add water and shake gently); 1x Remote Control (battery included); 1x ‎‎User Manual. If you have any questions about the room cooler, you can contact us at any time via Amazon or the instructions in the manual, and we will reply to you within 24 hours.(It comes with a 1-year warranty from the date of purchase, covering only manufacturing defects.)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kpuauxqpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SKYICE","source_asin":"B0BPH58LR8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-820325","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BPH58LR8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BPH58LR8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
