window.products.push({"id":820363,"name":"SMIRLY Charcuterie Boards Gift Set: Large Charcuterie Board Set, Bamboo Cheese Board Set - Unique Mothers Day Gifts for Mom - House Warming Gifts New ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":45.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+JjAFoU2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅Dazzle Your Guests - Every successful gathering needs our charcuterie board and cheese knife set. Our charcuterie tray is the largest round cheese board on the market and is accompanied by all the charcuterie board accessories you'll need for an epic party that will impress your guests. You won't find this size, quality, and aesthetic appeal elsewhere. Fill our serving board with a variety of foods and enjoy one of life's most enjoyable moments - time with friends & family. ✅The Entertainment Solution - Our large cheese board set is a must-have for your entertaining arsenal. All the cheese board accessories you'll need including a cheese knife set and 6 ceramic sauce dishes. Our expandable design features two pull out and removable drawers so you can easily throw a big bash with style and elegance. Host your next party with all the confidence and none of the stress. Our charcuterie set is also the perfect wine and cheese board for a quiet dinner for two. ✅Housewarming Gift They`ll Love - Our bamboo cheese board and cutlery set are the perfect gift for any modern couple, new homeowner, or apartment dweller. SMIRLY's unique and beautiful board, with so many beneficial features and accompanying accessories, comes with a sturdy decorative box for instant gifting. Everyone on your list, no matter the occasion, will love and appreciate this thoughtful, functional, and timeless gift. ✅Unleash Your Inner Charcuterie Artist - Charcuterie boards are an art form. You can design a unique and gorgeous platter for any festivity. Consider our bamboo cheese board a blank canvas on which you are the master artist creating the perfect ensemble of meats, cheeses, veggies, crackers, fruits, and chutneys to please any audience. Our board, bonus cheese board and stone server open up a world of possibilities. ✅Bamboo Rocks - Our bamboo cheese board and knife set are a smart purchase for so many reasons. Bamboo is earth friendly, properly sourced, and highly renewable. It's nonporous and resists liquid so it won't bend, warp, crack, absorb odor, or stain. This hardwood is super easy to clean and very durable. A truly low maintenance wood that retains its natural aesthetic value for years to come.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+JjAFoU2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SMIRLY","source_asin":"B08P4BBJB6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-820363","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08P4BBJB6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08P4BBJB6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
