window.products.push({"id":820393,"name":"Bosen's Centuries Weathered Old Sandalwood 40+ Sticks Pack - 8\" Stick Incense - 100% Natural - L007T40","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61nOA+KxJCL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This item is 40+ sticks (in 2.4 mm diameter) pack!!This incense is made of weathered old sandalwood from India. Due to special growing conditions and after many centuries weathering process, which has made this aged sandalwood to show its extraordinary quality. Heavy sandalwood resin makes its fragrance smell better than other branded sandalwood products in the open market now. The resource is rare and precious. We guarantee there is no extraction of sandalwood essential oil before making this incense. The smell will get better day by day if stored well. This is our most valuable sandalwood product for its top grade quality with ordinary price. Raw materials are 100% natural.p.s. This is pure aged sandalwood, and its aroma will linger there for a while even the stick incense has extinguished. Bosen incenses store doesn't blend with cheap sandalwood or other ingredients to dilute for lowering cost. Besides, older pure sandalwood incense, contains heavier resin, will smell better if stored well. This is an important characteristic of fully natural incense that those chemical and perfumed incense don't have.**Please note:--For those who got used to perfumed incense with strong scent, you may not be able to feel this fully natural fragrance. We suggest to fresh your nose for a few days (in order to recover olfactory senses) before burning this incense. **This incense will smell better in cool seasons.--For supporting environmental protection, some of our incense boxes are recycled used in order to reduce waste.--In the international market of raw materials, raw Sandalwood has become very expensive now because of its scarce. The value of Sandalwood incense is based on its purity and smell. Sandalwood incense contains stronger aroma with higher purity will be more popular and priced higher. (Too thick sandalwood scent won't make people feel comfortable.)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61nOA+KxJCL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bosen Incense","source_asin":"B08Y849PBF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-820393","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08Y849PBF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08Y849PBF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
