window.products.push({"id":820410,"name":"Le Creuset Enameled Cast-Iron 3-Quart Saucier Pan, Cobalt","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31k-7rry+SL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Modeled after the smooth, curved contours of the Soup Pot and Bouillabaisse Pot, this classic saucier pan by Le Creuset offers the steady heat distribution of cast iron and the seamless cooking surface required for building and stirring delicate sauces. The pan's wide, shallow shape facilitates easy stirring, while its gently flared sides encourage rapid reduction, concentrating flavors. The saucier holds up to 3 quarts and measures approximately 10-1/5 by 17-4/5 by 5-1/5 inches. Made of heavy-duty cast iron, the cookware's colorful, long-lasting exterior enamel resists chipping and cracking, while its durable, nonreactive sand-colored interior enamel offers a smooth surface for cooking and an optimal palette for food presentation. As cast iron is unexcelled for even heat distribution and superior heat retention, and enamel is impervious to acids and odors, the unit browns and cooks food uniformly and gently without hot spots and can be used for marinating, cooking on the stovetop, or finishing in the oven. The pan's long cast-iron handle and opposite helper handle facilitate convenient transport, while its secure-fitting lid locks in heat, moisture, and flavor. The lid also comes fitted with a black phenolic knob that's oven-safe up to 350 degrees F. Beautiful enough for the table yet durable enough to outlive its lifetime limited warranty, the saucier pan can be safely used on any stovetop, including induction, and should be hand washed for best results. Amazon.com Made of brightly enameled cast iron, the Le Creuset saucier pan is perfect for slowly simmering sauces or quickly reducing a broth. Cast iron retains and distributes heat evenly, making this round pot with its tight-fitting lid and non-abrasive bottom also an excellent choice for braising, simmering, browning, or poaching on any type of stovetop burner. And, because the black phenolic lid knob is oven-safe to 400 degrees, the pot and lid can be used to bake a casserole whose cheesy crust can be browned under the broiler with the lid removed. You can also use the enameled pot for marinating meats and storing leftovers in the refrigerator. The interior portion of the saucier measures approximately 8-1/2 inches across and 3 inches deep, holding up to 3 quarts. A helper handle opposite the long loop handle aids in lifting and carrying. Le Creuset is known for suffusing the exterior of its products with bright, modern colors, while keeping a more neutral tone on the interior to showcase the cuisine. The enamel interior resists cracking and staining and is best cared for when the contents are stirred with nylon, wood, or silicone utensils. It's also so smooth that food particles tend not to stick, making cleaning by hand or in the dishwasher a snap. Made in France, the Le Creuset saucier is guaranteed to be free of defects for the lifetime of the original owner, whether self-purchased or received as a gift. --Ann Bieri","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31k-7rry+SL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Le Creuset","source_asin":"B000N4Y8UG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-820410","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000N4Y8UG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000N4Y8UG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
