window.products.push({"id":820461,"name":"Smart Air Beds Platinum Queen Raised Air Bed with Remote Control, Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61KmYrC6YdL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The Smart Air Beds Platinum Queen Raised Air Bed is so comfortable, you may want to sleep on it yourself and give your guests your bed! Raised 19\" off the ground, this air bed is close to the height of a traditional mattress and box spring. The built-in pump is easy to use, and will have you ready for bed in about 3 minutes. When your ready to go to sleep, the Smart Air Beds Platinum Queen Raised Air Bed has a velvety soft deluxe flocked top that can be slept on or if you'd rather use sheets, you can use standard sheets. Use the remote AirTek comfort controller to select the firmness you prefer, either adding or deflating the bed to the exact firmness desired. Though the bed will always be closer to plush rather than extra firm (it is an air bed afterall), the controller allows you to adjust to your comfort level while laying on the bed. It's made of heavy-gauge PVC with electronically welded seams for lasting quality. Open the patented Giga valve to deflate the bed in no time! Simply roll it up, fold in the sides, and store compactly in the included matching duffel bag for portability and storage. You get maximum quality at a fraction of similar products you may have seen on TV or in bed & bath stores (which are over $200!). Why buy this bed? AirTek Remote Controller The remote controller allows you to adjust the amount of air in the bed while laying on it. Adjust the comfort as you want it – ultra plush or more firm. Comfort The luxurious flocked top is baby soft and wonderful to sleep on as is, however the bed will accommodate standard sheets. Add a cross beam construction for back support, and you have the recipe for a wonderful night of sleep.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61KmYrC6YdL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Smart Air Beds","source_asin":"B00E2C5BJC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-820461","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00E2C5BJC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00E2C5BJC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
