window.products.push({"id":820500,"name":"22 Pieces Non-slip Bathtub Stickers Adhesive Paw Print Bath Treads Non Slip Traction to Tubs Bathtub Stickers Adhesive Decals Anti-slip Appliques for ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71h+V3o3X0L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Your bathtub should be a haven of security, not a slippery accident waiting to happen. That's why we created bathtub stickers that create a non-slip bathtub floor to enhance overall safety. Our nonslip bathtub stickers set works the same way a tub mat does only that it's easier to set up. It's also lighter and easier to maintain. You only need to stick the individual stickers on the inner surface of your bathtub. Non-slip and not harmful to skin The surface of the sticker has approximately 1180 tiny protrusions which can protect you from slipping，but they are soft and do not hurt your skin. Good adhesion Bath stickers can adhere to most smooth and non-porous surfaces including glass, tile, fiberglass and some metals. Please don’t stick them on dirty and rough surface. These non-slip bathtub stickers are effective to stick to any smooth surface, such as a bathtub, bathroom floor or stairs, swimming pool, etc. They provide strong adhesion and good grip, effectively preventing slipping and ensuring safety for your kids, parents and yourselves. Enough amount There are 22 non-slip stickers, which are enough for 2 or 3 bathrooms. Easy to use Step1 Clean the bathtub to keep it smooth and dry. Step2 Take off the isolation paper and stick the sticker to the bathtub, and try your best to remove air bubbles meanwhile. Step3 Press hard to make it stick more firmly, and keep away from water within 24 hours. What You Will Get: 22 x Paw Footprint Bathtub Stickers In order to effectively prevent your kids, parents even youself from slipping in the bath, these stickers are must have. Make a good choice and click the Add to Cartbutton at the top right of this page to place your order now. if you are not satisfied, please contact us, we will never let you down! Enjoy your purchase.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71h+V3o3X0L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"livhil","source_asin":"B08CKQLWH7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-820500","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CKQLWH7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CKQLWH7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
