window.products.push({"id":820569,"name":"Oxygen Absorbers for Food Storage 300cc (Self-activating)-100 PCS (20 x Packs Of 5) O2 Absorbers Food Grade, Food Preserver Packets Deoxidizer-Absorbe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aozJt7p6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅【Self-activating Oxygen Absorbers】：Self-Activating Deoxidisers Are Not Dependent On The Presence Of Moisture In The Packaging (Normal Absorbents Need To Absorb Moisture From The Packaged Food To Perform Their Action), Removing Oxygen From The Sealed Packaging Of The Product And Create A Nitrogen Environment, Ideal For Dry Foods And Pharmaceuticals Use With Mylar Bags, Food Storage Buckets, Mason Jars And Vacuum Bags To Significantly Extend The Shelf Life Of Food Products. ✅【Convenient Small Package】：20 * 5 Pcs Individual Vacuum Bags To Minimize Waste, Prevent Oxygen Exposure, Maximize Its Effectiveness And Shelf Life, Reject The Wasteful Pain Of Large Packages Of Oxygen Absorbing Packs. Store Extra Oxygen Packets Safely When Not In Use To Extend Its Useful Life Up To Two Years. Experience of High-Quality Products Even One Year After Purchase. ✅【Powerful Oxygen Absorber】：REBEOUS Oxygen Observers 150% Of The Standard Capacity Of Oxygen Within 48 Hours And Continues To Be Effective Over A Long Period Of Time. We Use A High-Quality, Highly Absorbent Activated Iron Powder That Has Twice The Absorption Capacity Of Other Oxygen Removers. Which Makes It The Most Economical Oxygen Packets. ✅【SAFE AND ADDITIVE-FREE KEEP FOOD FRESH】：Oxygen Scavenger is Made From Iron Powder Which Reacts With O2 Producing Only Heat And No Odor, Using From Food-Grade Packaging Material, Safe To Use When In Contact With Food, By Removing Oxygen It Prevents The Oxidation Of Vitamins A, C, And E In Food, Thus Maintaining The Natural, Fresh Taste And Nutrition Of The Food. ✅【PERFECT FOR LONG TERM FOOD STORAGE】：Simply Place The O2 Absorbers Into The Sealed Container Of The High-Barrier Package And Create Conditions Suitable For Long-Term Food Storage Of Food By Continuously Eliminating Oxygen. When The Oxygen In The Sealed Package Is Depleted, The Oxygen Scavenger Will Temporarily Go Dormant. Long-Term Emergency Food Protection For Flours, Spices, Jerky Making, Grains, Legumes, Rice And Nuts, Dehydrated Food, And Harvest Right Freeze Dryer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aozJt7p6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"REBEOUS","source_asin":"B0BFXPHNQ5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-820569","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BFXPHNQ5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BFXPHNQ5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
