window.products.push({"id":820633,"name":"LANCON Laundry Bags for Delicates, Set of 4 (2 Large & 2 Medium)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/514IGV44VWL._AC_.jpg","description":"We’ve all had it happen one time or another—we threw our favorite lingerie or delicate garment into the washer without thinking twice about putting the wash cycle on delicate. What’s worse—we took out our load of laundry and discovered that our favorite delicate was pulled, torn, scratched, snagged, or even completely unrecognizable. Fortunately, this doesn’t need to be a reality we face ever again. LANCON’s 100% polyester mesh laundry, travel, and storage bags for lingerie, delicates, hosiery, bras, and undergarments offer the perfect solution. With their protective and durable material, both the clothes inside the mesh bag and the actual mesh laundry bag material are protected against the harsh spin cycles of your washer machine. Yet, the breathable and light material also keeps lingerie and delicates soft, clean, and looking brand new, even after multiple washes. Product Details: 1 Large 16” x 19” White Bags 1 Large 16” x 19” White Bags 2 Medium 12” x 16” White Bags 2 Medium 12” x 16” White Bags 1 Large 16” x 19” Black Bag 1 Large 16” x 19” Black Bag Features and Benefits:100% polyester mesh materialSmooth, secure zipper keeps clothes in and dirt, dust, etc. outWasher machine-safeReusable and versatile Use Instructions:Simply place your favorite lingerie, delicate, hosiery, bras, and undergarments in the bag, zip it closed and put the zipper in its secure location, place your mesh lingerie and delicate bag in the washer machine, and let the mesh material handle the rest. After washing, simply remove your delicates from the bag and let them air-dry. When they’re dry, place them back in the bag for storage and organization, or keep them out until the next time you need to wash them. Features and Benefits: 100% polyester mesh material 100% polyester mesh material Smooth, secure zipper keeps clothes in and dirt, dust, etc. out Smooth, secure zipper keeps clothes in and dirt, dust, etc. out Washer machine-safe Washer machine-safe Reusable and versatile Reusable and versatile Use Instructions: Simply place your favorite lingerie, delicate, hosiery, bras, and undergarments in the bag, zip it closed and put the zipper in its secure location, place your mesh lingerie and delicate bag in the washer machine, and let the mesh material handle the rest. After washing, simply remove your delicates from the bag and let them air-dry. When they’re dry, place them back in the bag for storage and organization, or keep them out until the next time you need to wash them.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/514IGV44VWL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LANCON","source_asin":"B01HTVMJRO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-820633","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01HTVMJRO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01HTVMJRO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
