window.products.push({"id":820701,"name":"EXA Set of 11 Hanging Woven Wall Basket Decor Violet Rustic Round Decorative Large Wall Decor - Handmade Seagrass Baskets - Rattan Wall Art, Flat Wick","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":70.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Z+zllFvFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌱 A NICE TOUCH TO SPACE: EXA woven basket wall decor is a precious gift from skilled Vietnamese artisans that makes your monotonous walls very attractive and decorative, adding homey warmth to any space! These delicate decorative seagrass baskets for wall hanging may provide an organic, natural, and rustic touch to your home. It's never been easier to give your space an instant refresh! 🌱 ENCHANTING BOHO STYLE: Our boho wall baskets are crafted from natural seagrass which has the elements of the natural reed, including some light green, beige and brown tones. These earthy colors tend to be easy and super stylish to decorate with. This 11-piece collection of decorative flat wicker baskets is a terrific way to add some breezy bohemian charm to your house and bring your living space an organic, natural, and rustic accent. 🌱 ENDLESS POSSIBILITIES: EXA basket wall decor is much more than a decorative piece! With zero chemical smell and various sizes, our products are perfectly fit for your kitchen, living room, and bedroom. The woven trays can be used to store food and various small things or can be used as placemats for hot pans or to serve bowls for candy and snacks. 🌱 HANDCRAFTED AND ECO-FRIENDLY: EXA flat wicker baskets are created of seagrass - a natural material that is both sustainable and biodegradable. Seagrass is one of the long-standing traditional industries in Vietnam. It is widely used in interior decoration and well-recognized for its beauty, durability, flexible construction, and high applicability to make various handicraft seagrass basket products, especially woven wall baskets. 🌱 EASY TO HANG AND KEEP CLEAN: Our seagrass wicker baskets arrive all ready to hang. There is a hook on the back of the products, so you can conveniently hang it on the wall. You can easily keep them clean by gently wiping with a damp cloth and then drying them in a cool place with gentle sunlight. 🌱 GREAT GIFT IDEA: This set of 11 wall hanging baskets can also be a perfect gift for your mother, friends, or beloved ones, who appreciates ethically made homeware and art. Our boho wall decor baskets will be a one-of-a-kind present that everyone will appreciate. We send in a high-quality package that is ready to impress your friends and family. 🌱 GUARANTEED OR YOUR MONEY BACK: For any reason, you're not completely satisfied, you are free to get in touch with us and you can ask for a replacement or full refund, no questions asked.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Z+zllFvFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EXA","source_asin":"B0BD3WCGNF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-820701","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BD3WCGNF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BD3WCGNF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
