window.products.push({"id":820757,"name":"MaKefeile Curtain Rods 2 Pack Black Matte Diameter1.1 Inch Heavy Duty For Aluminum Thickened Wall Mount Croppable Single Window Curtain Rods 43 Inch.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":62.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/519tl-cv+XL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100%Aluminium alloy ✅ Heavy duty curtain rods: Makefeile curtain rod is made of thickened aluminum alloy, wall thickness 1.8mm, diameter 1.1in, surface using high photophoresis spray painting technology, no aging, no rust, no falling off, compared to iron curtain rod longer service life, more perfect appearance. ✅ Adjustable curtain rod : Compared to traditional telescopic curtain rods, Our curtain rods can single rod use or splicing use, Splicing can double the length of the curtain rod. Two curtain rod connection of the same diameter can visually bring the beauty of balance on both sides, and the curtain slides more easily.curtain rods for windows 43 to 86 in. ✅Curtain rod: In order to solve the noise generated when pulling the curtain, we have added a unique smooth silent strip on the rod, with the ABS silencer ring together with the curtain rod, which not only slides very smoothly, but also achieves the effect of near-zero noise, giving you a quiet and comfortable living environment. ✅Window curtains rod: Makefeile rod adopts the classic design concept style of Western European designers, new upgraded mounting bracket making the curtain rod look more beautiful and harmonious. The unique thickened material accentuates the texture of the curtain rod. ✅Curtain rods: Aluminum alloy curtain rod can be applied to different occasions and different curtains, like bedrooms, living rooms, kitchen, offices, hospitals, schools, etc. Suitable for hanging rings, perforated curtains.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/519tl-cv+XL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MaKefeile","source_asin":"B0BRSKPPF7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-820757","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BRSKPPF7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BRSKPPF7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":820758,"name":"MeesMeek Digital Travel Alarm Clock: Small Bedside LCD Clock with Date Temperature Snooze Backlight 12/24H Weekend Mode and 2 Volume, Folding Desk Clo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61OGEfRkWhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Easy to Use Multifunctional Digital Clock】3.54 inch clear eye-protection LCD display shows clock time, alarm time, calendar date, day of the week and indoor temperature (℉/℃). 6 control buttons are designed on the front for intuitive and simple operation. All settings can be completed in minutes. 12H/24H time format is available. Temperature units can be switched between Fahrenheit and Celsius. 【Small and Light Basic Bedside Clock】This balck foldable digital clock is made of high quality ABS material. The modern and minimalist look makes it suitable for bedroom, office, living room, dormitory, dinning room or any other room. The pocket size (4\"*3.15\"*0.75\") makes it a portable alarm clock that can be used on your nightstand, table, desk or keep it in your handbag when you travel. It is a ideal gift for adults, children, teenagers, students and kids boy. 【9-Mins Snooze and Weekend Mode】When the alarm goes off, press the big snooze button will give you an extra 9 minutes of sleep. One-press to activate the weekend mode, the alarm will only go off from Monday to Friday and it will not disturb you on the weekend. Weekend mode only works when the alarm is on. Tip: When the alarm sounds, if you do nothing, it will go off for 3 minutes, snooze for 7 minutes, repeat the cycle 3 times and then turn itself off. 【2 Levels Alarm Volume and Backlight】One alarm with standard beeps. 2 levels of alarm volume to meet your different needs (70dB/85dB). Simply click the snooze button can illuminate the clock face for 5 seconds, making it easy to read even in the dark or at night. Toggle the switch on the right side of the alarm clock to select the brightness of the backlight (High Bright/Dim). Note: The white backlight will not stay on. It will only last for 5s each time the snooze button is pressed. 【Battery Operated and Low Battery Alert】Powered by 2 AAA batteries (included), a new pair of AAA batteries will last up to 6 months. When the low battery icon appears on the screen to remind you that it is time to replace the batteries. Note: When the display keeps flashing 8888 and the clock beeps, it's also time to replace the batteries. What you get: 1*MeesMeek digital travel alarm clock, 1*user manual, 2*AAA batteries.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61OGEfRkWhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MeesMeek","source_asin":"B0BK95CGNG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-820758","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BK95CGNG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BK95CGNG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
