window.products.push({"id":820766,"name":"Aprilaire 4300 Whole House Air Purifier, High Efficiency Air Cleaner w/One Touch Controls","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41PzvF7DyeL._AC_.jpg","description":"About Aprilaire 4300rsquo;s Whole House High Efficiency Air Cleaner with One Touch Control Purifying the air throughout your entire house has never been easier than with the high tech, efficient system of the Aprilaire 4300 Whole House High Efficiency Air Cleaner with One Touch Control. Whether your homersquo;s heating and cooling systems are split or smaller, this air cleaner will remain true to its energy efficient promise and keep your air fresh and breathable. By pulling air from your rooms, filtering it and then recirculating the fresh product, the Aprilaire 4300 Whole House High Efficiency Air Cleaner with One Touch Control is able to keep your air clean for a fraction of the price of other air purifiers. With the one touch control system, you are guaranteed the best air quality imaginable. This superior filter traps and eliminates 98 percent of airborne particles within a 19.4 square foot of surface area. Never fear your allergies again as pet dander, pollen and mold spores are eliminated from your air supply, making the air more breathable and less irritating.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41PzvF7DyeL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aprilaire","source_asin":"B005D2IAJS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-820766","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005D2IAJS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B005D2IAJS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
