window.products.push({"id":820819,"name":"CHRUN Heated Blanket Electric Throw with 6 Hours Auto-Off & 4 Heating Levels, Single Fleece Blanket 50\" x 60\" with Fast Heating & Machine Washable, Ho","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615Tp7--o3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"One-key Operation: Easy to control the heating temperature by pushing one button on the controller, select the temperature you want in 4 heating levels (range: 84-105℉), then you will get required warmth after a few minutes. The electric blanket is equipped with automatic shutdown function after 6 hours heating, so you enjoy it worry free. Single Side Velvet Material: The electric blanket is made of luxurious and soft one side velvet that is skin-friendly, heat preserving, increasing comfort greatly. With a large size (50\" x 60\"), it hugs your whole body. Whether for reading in bed or watching a movie on the couch, you'll obtain springlike warmth on a chill winter day. Easy to Clean: Both machine washing and hand washing are available. Remove the control connector to disconnect the power cord from the pad first before cleaning. Please remember no dry cleaning! Don't use bleach and the wringer! No ironing! Do not insert pads and the connector before they are completely dry. Multi-purpose Blanket: This electric blanket is useful including as a shoulder cape, a lap robe, and a cover blanket or keeping warm in an air conditioning room as well, meeting all your needs. It is also an optimum gift for your friends and family. It brings those received electric blankets much warmth and happiness whether on holidays or at ordinary times. Safety Certificate: With overheat protection function, this electric blanket is ETL certified, so you can use it carefreely. The heating wire layout of the blanket is unique to make its heat distribution evener, and to make it heat in a constant speed and cool evenly, thus enhancing your comfort experience.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615Tp7--o3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CHRUN","source_asin":"B0BV5VPZSH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-820819","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BV5VPZSH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BV5VPZSH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
